<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Roche DC.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Roche DC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued three million American-style call warrants on Roche DC, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled  by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10500 CHF		 PREMIUM	12.66 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.65 CHF		  GEARING	14.9 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	29.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS ECHANGE	   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  9910 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
